  {
    "hotel_id": "6587859",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/yotelair-singapore-changi-airport_2/hotel/singapore-sg.html",
    "name": "YOTELAIR Singapore Changi Airport at Jewel",
    "detail": "For Transit passengers in Singapore, stay at YOTELAIR Singapore Changi Airport at Jewel so you cam maximize your Jewel experience. You can shop until the last store is open, and start exploring the Jewel before the hordes of Jewel visitors come in the morning. You can also enjoy the outlets open 24/7 without rushing to go back to your downtown hotel. For photo-ops, you get to have unlimited opportunities to capture the best of Jewel by staying INSIDE the Jewel itself, that is Yotelair. The rooms maybe tight and lacks the comfort of regular hotels, but you get what you pay for and more, for an airport transit hotel. Way better than a capsule hotel. The room is clean and security is OK, no need to worry about your valuables. There is also free coffee 24/7. Down side is YOTELAIR does not accept US Dollars as hotel deposit, only credit cards. Since we booked and paid for our stay using AGODA, the hotel asks for US$100 security deposit only in cash.",
